Every Pointian has a complicated mix of needs that will have to be met in order to keep them happy and maintain their '''Mood'''.

==[[File:Happiness-Icon.png|50px]] Happiness==
Satisfying the other variables on this page will contribute to a Pointian's overall happiness. Happy Pointians will work or learn more effectively, and unhappy Pointians will threaten to leave.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Happiness|25px|Methods of directly increasing happiness|alt=Happiness+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Happiness|25px|Methods of directly decreasing happiness|alt=Happiness-ve-Icon}}

==Needs==
Every Pointian has needs that must be met to keep them well and raise their overall [[#Happiness|happiness]].

===[[File:Energy-Icon.png|50px]] Energy===
Reflecting how long a Pointian can go before they will need to rest. Staff can recover their energy in the [[Staff Room]], whereas Students will need to sleep in a their [[Dormitory]] (unless they belong to the [[Clubs#Power-Nap Club|Power-Nap Club]], in which case they will sleep anywhere - even while walking!). Various activities, such as [[Coffee Kiosk|drinking coffee]], will provide an additional energy boost.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Energy|25px|Methods of increasing energy|alt=Energy+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Energy|25px|Methods of decreasing energy|alt=Energy-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Healthiness-Icon.png|50px]] Healthiness===
Reflecting the Pointian's overall constitution. This is increased by fresh air, exercise and healthy eating, and adversely affected by junk food.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Healthiness|25px|Methods of increasing Healthiness|alt=Healthiness+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Healthiness|25px|Methods of decreasing Healthiness|alt=Healthiness-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Food-Icon.png|50px]] Food===
Fuel for the fire! Pointians will need access to food, preferably healthy, in order to keep going. [[:Category:Vending Machines|Vending Machines]] will do the trick, but [[:Category:Kiosks|Kiosks]] are better.
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Hunger|25px|Methods of decreasing hunger|alt=Food+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Hunger|25px|Methods of increasing hunger|alt=Food-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Drink-Icon.png|50px]] Drink===
Drinking is likewise essential to staying alive. Once again, [[:Category:Kiosks|Kiosks]] are the way to go, along with the likes of the [[Water Cooler]].
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Thirst|25px|Methods of reducing thirst|alt=Drink+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Thirst|25px|Methods of increasing thirst|alt=Drink-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Toilet-Comfort-Icon.png|50px]] Toilet Comfort===
Everybody... goes. [[Bathroom]]s are used for the relief of both [[Students]] and [[Staff]], so they should be made readily available.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Toilet Comfort|25px|Methods of increasing Toilet Comfort|alt=Toilet-Comfort+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Toilet Comfort|25px|Methods of decreasing Toilet Comfort|alt=Toilet-Comfort-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Hygiene-Icon.png|50px]] Hygiene===
{{Main|Campuses#Hygiene{{!}}Hygiene}}
It is important that Pointians have sufficient access to [[Bathroom]]s and [[Shower Room]]s, so as to avoid becoming... unpleasant. They will not like that, and nor will anyone around them.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Hygiene|25px|Methods of increasing hygiene|alt=Hygiene+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Hygiene|25px|Methods of decreasing hygiene|alt=Hygiene-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Entertainment-Icon.png|50px]] Entertainment===
This variable is possessed only by [[Students]]. [[Events]] such as parties, live concerts and film nights can satisfy a Student's craving for entertainment, as can numerous items.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Entertainment|25px|Items that increase entertainment|alt=Entertainment+ve-Icon}}

==Environment==
Pointians will flourish in an attractive and comfortable space, and like to be impressed by their surroundings.

===[[File:Attractiveness-Icon.png|50px]] Attractiveness===
{{Main|Campuses#Attractiveness{{!}}Attractiveness}}
A multitude of items are available to make both indoor and outdoor spaces more attractive, and should be used to create a strong coverage, so that Pointians can enjoy their environment.
<br>
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Attractiveness|25px|Items that increase attractiveness|alt=Attractiveness+ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Temperature-Icon.png|50px]] Thermal Comfort===
{{Main|Campuses#Temperature{{!}}Temperature}}
The temperature will vary from campus to campus, with cold, temperate and warm environments to be navigated. Cooling items are available to place in indoor spaces, with heating items for both indoors and outdoors, to keep things comfortable for the Pointians.
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Temperature|25px|Items that increase temperature|alt=Temperature+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Temperature|25px|Items that decrease temperature|alt=Temperature-ve-Icon}}

===[[File:Prestige-Icon.png|50px]] Prestige===
{{Main|Rooms#Prestige{{!}}Prestige}}
Prestige is the measure of how impressive the environment is. Placing items will increase the prestige of that space, be it a room, corridor, or outside.

==Career==
This section is specific to [[Staff]], and addresses how well they feel their contributions are being received and respected.

===[[File:Salary-Icon.png|50px]] Pay Satisfaction===
Reflecting how happy the staff member is with their compensation. A little boost can increase their happiness!
<br>??Icons for Different states??

===[[File:Training-Icon.png|50px]] Training===
{{Main|Staff Training}}
Staff enjoy training, and becoming more effective. The [[Training Room]] is used for this.

==Facilities==
This section is specific to [[Students]], and reflects how well they are enjoying their campus life.

===[[File:Accommodation-Icon.png|50px]] Accommodation===
Every student will need a [[Dormitory]], with each bed ideally shared between no more than five. They will become unhappy in an overcrowded dorm, and increasingly happy the more privacy they are afforded.

===[[File:Personal-Goal-Icon.png|50px]] Personal Goals===
Students will often appeal for items they need placing to achieve their goals, such as completing an assignment, joining a [[Clubs|Club]], or finding a new [[Relationships|relationship]].

===[[File:Club-Icon.png|50px]] Clubs===
{{Main|Clubs}}
Students can find fellowship in clubs, and each will grant an advantage, such as increased [[#Energy|energy]] or movement speed.

===[[File:Relationships-Icon.png|50px]] Relationships===
{{Main|Relationships}}
Both friendships and romance are to be found on campus, and a healthy variety of [[:Category:Relationship Items|relationship items]] will allow students to build trust with their peers.

===[[File:Currency-Icon.png|50px]] Tuition Fees===
Tuition fees are adjusted on the Course Screen, and can be raised, which will negatively affect this variable, or lowered, which will do the opposite.

==[[File:Movement-Speed-Icon.png|50px]] Movement Speed==
Movement Speed can be widely variable. It can be increased by various [[Events]], receiving an [[#Energy|Energy Buzz]], or by [[Staff]] who [[train]] in the [[Aerodynamics]] [[Qualification]]. It can also be decreased by various [[Medical Issues|Medical]] and [[Pastoral Issues]].
::{{i2|:Category:Increases Movement Speed|25px|Metheds of increasing Movement Speed|alt=Movement-Speed+ve-Icon}}
::{{i2|:Category:Decreases Movement Speed|25px|Metheds of decreasing Movement Speed|alt=Movement-Speed-ve-Icon}}

